{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1488512-shards-of-ice-rage","id":1488512,"title":"Shards of Ice Rage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-30T17:32:47-07:00","id":1488512,"title":"Shards of Ice Rage","content":"So, with this Gift the garou summons a number of Ice Shards equals to his number of success on a Wits+ Primal-Urge roll. The gift's text says he can use a different action to attack a target with one shard, and then use to attack another in another action, etc. My question is couldn't he direct all the shards at once against a single target? It's not explicitly stated in the Gift's text. What's your opinion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-31T01:41:28-07:00","id":1488540,"title":"","content":"Edit because i realised Meister missed what the gift actually does:<br /> <br /> Actually you got it wrong, it doesn't say anything about actions. What it does is different, when you activate the gift you get X attack rolls where X is equal to the number of succeses on your Wits + Primal Urge roll, and you attack that many times that round. That's why it stops you from using Rage for extra actions on the round you are using it, it's because you get X (small) attacks for 1 Rage.<br /> <br /> As for targeting, your choice what the target is. It doesn't say &quot;different&quot; target anywhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":1182,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","user":"Asmodai","date":". 07-31-2022, 05:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-31T15:09:20-07:00","id":1488604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1488512-shards-of-ice-rage?p=1488540#post1488540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit because i realised Meister missed what the gift actually does:<br /> <br /> Actually you got it wrong, it doesn't say anything about actions. What it does is different, when you activate the gift you get X attack rolls where X is equal to the number of succeses on your Wits + Primal Urge roll, and you attack that many times that round. That's why it stops you from using Rage for extra actions on the round you are using it, it's because you get X (small) attacks for 1 Rage.<br /> <br /> As for targeting, your choice what the target is. It doesn't say &quot;different&quot; target anywhere.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> From my reading, you summon shards of ice and you can hurl them at your opponents, they are not a &quot;claws of the north&quot; sort of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T02:03:16-07:00","id":1488678,"title":"","content":"Yes, but it's a wrong reading. It's essentially a gift that generates extra attacks with those shards through the roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}